SUMMARY:Live Music featuring award-winning vocalist Patty Reese at Flying Ace Farm
DESCRIPTION:LIVE MUSIC FEATURING AWARD-WINNING VOCALIST PATTY REESE\nJoin us for weekend live music on Sunday\, October 4th\, from 2-5pm\,featuring award-winning vocalist Patty Reese at Flying Ace Farm.\nJoin us Sunday\, October 4\, from 2–5 PM for live music featuring award-winning Americana artist Patty Reese at Flying Ace Farm in Lovettsville\, Virginia. Enjoy handcrafted spirits\, fresh BBQ\, local beer\, and beautiful mountain views while Patty performs her award-winning blend of Americana\, blues\, soul\, and roots music. Admission is free and seating is first come\, first served. \nPatty’s Bio: \nPatty Reese is a 17-time Wammie Award winner whose powerful vocals and songwriting have earned recognition throughout the Mid-Atlantic. She has shared stages with artists including Aretha Franklin\, Buddy Guy\, Greg Allman\, Beth Hart\, and Little Feat. Her latest album\, Lift Us Up\, showcases her signature Americana\, blues\, and soul sound. \nTo learn more about Patty Reese\, visit her official website\, Facebook page and YouTube channel. \nBe sure to check out our full Live Music Schedule to see all upcoming performances at Flying Ace Farm.
URL:https://flyingacefarm.com/calendar/live-music-patty-reese-3/
LOCATION:Flying Ace Farm\, 40950 Flying Ace Lane\, Lovettsville\, VA\, 20180\, US
CATEGORIES:Family,Live Music,local
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://flyingacefarm.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/IMG_0981.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Flying Ace Farm":MAILTO:info@flyingacefarm.com
END:VEVENT
