SUMMARY:Live Music w/ John "JP" Jones at Flying Ace Farm
DESCRIPTION:Live Music featuring John (JP) Jones at Flying Ace Farm\nJoin us on Saturday\, October 17th\, from 3-6PM for live music featuring John “JP” Jones. \nBio:\nI grew up in Lucketts\, Va. I still call Loudoun County home. Began teaching myself guitar around age 10 using chord books and listening to records. Since then\, music has been a major part of my life- playing at family gatherings\, at church\, weddings and local wineries and breweries. My wife Lori and I have been married 41 years\, We have three grown children and three grandchildren. I am a dedicated husband\, father grandfather\, veteran and a lifelong artist. \nTo learn more about John\, visit his official website \nYou can also view his Instagram page \nTo view our full music line-up\, click on our Calendar of Events \n 
URL:https://flyingacefarm.com/calendar/live-music-w-john-jp-jones-at-flying-ace-farm-10/
LOCATION:Flying Ace Farm
CATEGORIES:Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://flyingacefarm.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/john-jp-jones-pic.jpg
END:VEVENT
