SUMMARY:Live Music featuring Britton James at Flying Ace Farm
DESCRIPTION:LIVE MUSIC FEATURING BRITTON JAMES AT FLYING ACE FARM\nJoin us for live music on Sunday\, December 27th\, from 2-5pm\, featuring Britton James at Flying Ace Farm in Lovettsville\, Virginia.\nJoin us for live music at Flying Ace Farm on Sunday\, December 27th\, from 2–5 PM\, featuring Northern Virginia musician Britton James. Relax with handcrafted American Ace Spirits\, fresh BBQ\, locally brewed beer\, and beautiful mountain views while enjoying an afternoon of live entertainment. Admission is free\, and seating is available on a first-come\, first-served basis. \nAbout Britton James\nA Northern Virginia native\, Britton James is a talented singer-songwriter\, producer\, and multi-instrumentalist who writes\, records\, and performs original alternative music. His energetic one-man show is anything but ordinary\, combining live vocals with percussion\, bass\, guitar\, and looping techniques to create the sound of a full band—all performed live on stage. \nWith a diverse musical style\, Britton seamlessly blends his original songs with crowd-favorite covers spanning decades\, from timeless classics to today’s biggest hits. His dynamic performances and engaging stage presence make every show a unique experience for music lovers of all ages. \nTo learn more about Britton James\, visit his official website \nBe sure to check out our full Live Music Schedule to see all upcoming performances at Flying Ace Farm. \n \n \n 
